OL,3,GNEWSABody found in Lough Erne formally
OL,4,Aidentified as Carrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a woman recovered from
OL,7,FLough Erne in Enniskillen, County
OL,8,FFermanagh, has been formally identified
OL,9,Fas Carrie Mullane (Noonan), police have
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe 39-year-old from Limerick went
OL,13,Fmissing in Enniskillen on 10 October.
OL,15,FA body was recovered from the lough on
OL,16,F9 November and a formal identification
OL,17,Fprocess took place.
OL,19,FMichael Lynch, 35, of Trasna Park in
OL,20,FEnniskillen, has been charged with her
OL,21,Fmurder and preventing lawful burial.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
